  💡 **My Recommendation for You**

  Start with Option 1 (Direct Docker Compose) because:
  1. ✅ Simple - You already have everything ready
  2. ✅ Cost-effective - Single VPS (~$5-10/month)
  3. ✅ Full control - You manage everything
  4. ✅ No vendor lock-in - Works anywhere
  5. ✅ Your stack is perfect for it - Already using Compose

  Suggested Providers (easiest to cheapest):
  1. DigitalOcean - $6/month, excellent docs, easy UI
  2. Hetzner - $4/month, best price/performance
  3. Linode - $5/month, good support
  4. AWS EC2 - More complex, but free tier available

  Typical Timeline:
  • Server setup: 15 minutes
  • Application deployment: 10 minutes
  • SSL setup: 10 minutes
  • Testing: 15 minutes
  • Total: ~1 hour for first deployment

